  "details": "A vulnerability was identified in Furion .NET Framework up to 4.9.9.92. The impacted element is the function String.Replace of the file framework/Furion/Templates/Extensions/StringRenderExtensions.cs. The manipulation of the argument Name leads to sql injection. Remote exploitation of the attack is possible. The exploit is publicly available and might be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
